{"id": "t040-057", "text": "isaac took me thru his whole vinyl collection lol. mostly 70s soul and jazz, like 2000 records, an original blue note pressing nobody's allowed to touch. goes to record fairs most months w/ his son. he's hunting for a curtis mayfield first press, if i ever see one grab it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "isaac", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl collection", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "70s soul", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "jazz", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "2000 records", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "original blue note pressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "record fairs", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "most months"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "hunting for a curtis mayfield first press", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "grab it", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
